      "en": "The nations will see and be ashamed of all their might. They will lay their hand on their mouth. Their ears will be deaf.",
      "ko": "가로되 열방이 보고 자기의 세력을 부끄려서 손으로 그 입을 막을 것이요 귀는 막힐 것이오며",
      "source_text_hash": "e269d43811053659ead0db6d7a73cdb44807ba17ad59fcfe8c85aeb3f19e5219",
      "translation_text_hash": "16960883a2933027faf33baacf7008617944af90dad6f4af4f8d90ace55cb454",
